  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Redemptorist Missionaries Devlopment  Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Redemptionists work in the impoverished north east of Brasil providing support for poor communities through small-scale projects. These include educational courses, health work, training in skills such as dress making, and in the case of emergencies immediate relief for residents. The partner emphasises the importance of empowering the poor to change their own lives and work to create positive conditions to integrate them into society by raising awareness of their situation to the wider public.</narrative>
  </description>
